/**
 * @defgroup Logger Logger module
 * @brief Ready-to-use logger module.
 * 
 * @details
 * Provides everything needed for logging:
 * - Logging levels: INFO, DEBUG, WARN, ERROR, etc.
 * - Supports multiple sinks: console, file, or custom sinks.
 * - Utilities for formatting log messages.
 * 
 * @note
 * For more control or custom behaviour, see the Core module.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup Core Logger core module
 * @brief Logger core module.
 * 
 * @details
 * Provides the foundational interfaces and mechanisms for logging.
 * 
 * This module is fully open and designed for extension. Advanced
 * users can build their own logging solutions on top of it without
 * using ready-to-use logger module.
 * 
 * @note
 * Primarily intended for internal usage, but can be safely extended.
 */

